### Main Activities Endpoints
# Authentication is included below - run the auth request first to get a token

### Authenticate
# @name auth
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/authentication/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

###
# Capture the access token from the response
@access_token = {{auth.response.body.token}}

### List Main Activities
# Get a list of all available company main activities
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{apiVersion}}/company-main-activities
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
